        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Big-M method"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Dual Simplex"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Graphical method"
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionId": "A"
    },
    {
      "id": "or-bank-set-03-q005",
      "text": "In transportation problem, if a cell has negative opportunity cost:",
